<Base title="How We Work | ITKeepers"><section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">How we work</p><h1>Know the environment.<br>Watch the signals.<br>Own the follow-through.</h1><p class="lead">The difference is not a tool list. It is how familiar engineers share context, escalate internally and stay involved.</p></section><section class="section light"><div class="split"><div><h2>From signal to follow-up.</h2><p>Automated monitoring can surface issues continuously. Human coverage and response commitments depend on the service agreement.</p></div><div><article><h3>Assess impact</h3><p>Serious issues are prioritized around business impact and context.</p></article><article><h3>Bring in the right colleague</h3><p>Engineers can escalate internally without making the client rebuild the story from zero.</p></article><article><h3>Document and revisit</h3><p>Shared records and reporting keep open actions, changes and recommendations visible.</p></article></div></div></section></Base>